  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Water in Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to increased sustainable access to water resources, including increased regional integration and economic development for present and future generations in southern Africa. The regional program is an integrated part of SADCs regional strategic action plan.
The programme consists of 4 components: 1) A regional consultancy fund to further integration water resource management, 2) A regional water research fund to further research in integrated water resource management, 3) Awareness and information to increase knowledge on integrated water resource management among decision makers, 4) Administration and programme development.</narrative>
  </description>
